{"study_accession":"PRJNA903865","secondary_study_accession":"SRP408933","title":"HIV TAT-interacting protein 2 (HTATIP2) in T cell regulation and type 1 diabetes","description":"We completed the first genome-wide association study of the age at diagnosis of type 1 diabetes as a quantitative trait. Our analysis found a locus on chromosome 11 containing the SNP rs10833518. Functional studies implicate HTATIP2 as the causal gene for this association. The data in this project are RNA-seq results from primary human CD4+ T cells transfected with non-targeting siRNA as a control or with siRNA SMARTpool targeting HTATIP2.","pubmed":"","geo_series":"","n_samples":6,"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN31815502","study_accession":"PRJNA903865","blood_class":"blood_cells","class_from":"sample","title":"Human sample from Homo sapiens","description":"Homo sapiens","sex":"not provided","geo_sample":"","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2022-11-23","attributes":[["isolate","Donor 1"],["age","missing"],["biomaterial_provider","Hakonarson"],["sex","not provided"],["tissue","Blood"],["cell_subtype","T cell"],["cell_type","CD4+"],["disease","Healthy"],["treatment","Non-targeting"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR22356755","experiment_accession":"SRX18327663","library_layout":"PAIRED","library_selection":"PolyA","instrument_model":"Illumina NovaSeq 6000","read_count":41360393,"base_count":8354799386,"first_public":"2022-11-23","experiment_title":"Illumina NovaSeq 6000 sequencing: RNA-seq of human CD4: control siRNA"}],"labels":[]},{"sample_accession":"SAMN31815503","study_accession":"PRJNA903865","blood_class":"blood_cells","class_from":"sample","title":"Human sample from Homo sapiens","description":"Homo sapiens","sex":"not provided","geo_sample":"","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2022-11-23","attributes":[["isolate","Donor 2"],["age","missing"],["biomaterial_provider","Hakonarson"],["sex","not provided"],["tissue","Blood"],["cell_subtype","T cel